ers and directors  lining up for the project  only to eventually depart ezra miller  then debuted as barry allen with a brief  cameo in batman vs superman  dawn of justice before going on to star  in justice league in 2017  since then a number of changes have  forced miller's flash solo film to hop  around the calendar  now it seems it may have finally found  its spot  with it director andy muschietti and  birds of prey writer christina hodson  taking the reins the flash is now  expected to arrive in 2022  provided it can make it to the finish  the film is a sure fire to be a hit  let's just hope it can actually make it  off the starting line  like the flash jason mamoa's aquaman  first appeared in a brief cameo in  batman vs superman dawn of justice  before going on to become one of justice  league's biggest scene stealers for his  first solo film director james wan  and momoa delivered a massive underseat  epic that combined superhero adventure  with epic fantasy storytelling and a  brighter more comedic outlook than  previous dceu films  the result was a box office mega hit  that grossed more than one billion  dollars after its release  during the 2018 holiday season with that  in mind  a sequel was pretty much inevitable in  february 2019  warner brothers announced that aquaman 2  was indeed moving forward  and would arrive in theaters four years  after the first film mamoa is set to  return to reprise his  role as the titular superhero and juan  has signed on to produce and possibly  direct  two aquaman twos flashes down in  theaters on december 16  2022 check out one of our newest videos  right here plus even more looper videos  about your favorite movies are coming  soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one
 

